      "message": "David, thank you for updating the driver. Some questions:\n1. Can you pelase confirm that it official decision that we would like to change from generic to iwl7000? Last time we heard that generic is well tested and we should not change but that was in 2024 Dec.\n2. In 2024 Q2, Connectivity team was insisting to run extra check to make sure IWL7000 is fine, I suggest the same now as obviously `chromeos-6.6` baseline differs from `android15-6.6-desktop`. @billyzhao@google.com should know better than me.",
