      "message": "1. My understanding is that iwl7000 provides significant benefits over the upstream iwlwifi driver. I am guessing that I was not part of the discussions in 2024 Dec, but I\u0027d appreciate an opportunity to learn more about where the message not to change.\n2. Happy to do some additional validation, but I\u0027m not aware of what validation needs to be run. As it stands, I think `chromeos-6.6` is the most reasonable approximation of `android15-6.6-desktop` that has exhaustive connectivity test coverate. @billyzhao@google.com let me know if I\u0027m missing suites.",
